# What the image build does not need: local environments, caches, builds, the documentation and the upstream
# checkouts some developers keep at the root. The Dockerfile copies only pyproject.toml, README.md, LICENSE, mizuoto/,
# packages/native/ and scripts/build_wheels.py; this keeps the build context small.
.git
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/node_modules
**/*.egg-info
mizuoto/webui/dist
dist
build
packages/native/*/build
site
tests
/CosyVoice
/F5-TTS
/fish-speech
/GPT-SoVITS
/index-tts
/OmniVoice
/Qwen3-TTS
